<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">2 JO KORINT</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot Jo Korint</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Jo Korint</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kor</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO KORINT</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga me aryo ma Paulo ocoyo bot jo Korint ocoyo ikare ma winye ikin gi ki Kanica me Korint onongo pe ber. Ikare meno onongo jo mogo ikin dano ma i Kanica gubedo ki woo ikom Paulo, ento en ocoyo waraga man kun nyutu ni emito yubu ber bedo ikin gi dok bene nyutu yomcwiny madit ka yub man bicobe kakare. I acaki me waraga man Paulo otito lok ma mako kwo matye ikin gi ki kanica, kun tito bene kamaleng gin ango ma oweko en ecoyo waraga ki gero pi lok ayet ki jemo matye ikanica kun bene tito ni geronenu okelo ngut ki ber bedo ikin gi. Ka lacen en bene okok botgi me bedo ki cwiny me jogo jami me acwalo bot lukricitayo matye i Judea ma piny oloyogi. I cura ma gigiko, Paulo onyutu kun moko lok bot jo ma gicaye ni en pe ebedo lakwena me ada.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo ki kanica me Korint <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 1:12-7:16">1:12—7:16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">kony pi lukricitayo matye i Judea <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1—9:15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo onyutu ni en lakwena me ada <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10:1—13:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ladol lok <char style="ior"><ref loc="2CO 13:11-14">13:11-14</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:1">Tic 18:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ma lakwena pa Kricito Yecu pi mit pa Lubanga, ki bot ominwa Temceo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Bot jo ma oye Lubanga matye i Korint, kacel ki jo pa Lubanga ducu ma gitye i lobo Akaya:<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Kica ki kuc ma a ki bot Lubanga Wonwa ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo omiyo pwoc bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Pak obed bot Lubanga ma en aye Won Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, Won kica ki Lubanga ma lakwe cwiny ducu. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />En kweyo cwinywa ican ducu ma walimo wek wan bene wabed ki twero me kweyo cwiny jo matye ki can mo mapatpat, kun wakweyo cwinygi ikit yo acelu ma Lubanga okweyo kwede cwinywani. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Pien kit macalo watye ka nywako kacel ican madit ma Kricito yam ociro, kitmeno pi Kricito wan bene wanywako kacel i kweyo cwinywa i yo madit mukato kakare. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Kace waneno can, meno bedo me lakwe cwinywu, me larewu. Ka kikweyo cwinywa, meno bene miyo kikweyo cwinywu, ci miyo wucako nongo tek bene me ciro kit can acel ma wan wacironi. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Watye ki gen matek ikomwu, pien wangeyo ni, ka wunywako kwedwa ican ma waciro, kitmeno bene kibikweyo cwinywu kit macalo yam kikweyo kwede cwinywa.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Kor 15:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Utmegina, pe wamito ni wubed labongo niang ikom can ma waneno i Acia; pekone odiyowa marac mukato kare woko ma pe dok cire, omiyo pe dong wabedo ki gen mo me bedo makwo. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Onongo dong wangeyo ni kityeko ngolo kop me to iwiwa. Meno otime wek pe wajenge ikomwa kekenwa, ento wajenge ikom Lubanga ma cero jo ma oto. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />En olarowa ki ican me to marac macalo man, dok bene bilarowa; wamoko bene genwa ikome ni bilarowa dok aye. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Myero wuribe kwedwa ilega, wek omii jo mapol gupwo Lubanga pirwa, pi gin maber ma kitimo botwa pi lega pa jo mapol.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo oloko yub me wote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Gin ma wanyate pire en ene: wangeyo icwinywa ada ni wakwo i lobo man, makatone wan wakwo kacel kwedwu i ada, kun cwinywa bene leng ikit ma Lubanga mito, pe pi ryeko pa dano, ento pi kica pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Wan wacoyo botwu gin ma wutwero kwano dok wuniang. Ageno ni wubiniang matut, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kadi bed dong kombedi wuniang ikomwa manoknok. Meno bimiyo wubiwake pirwa calo wan bene wabiwake pirwu inino pa Rwotwa Yecu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Pien onongo ceng aniang man maber, omiyo yam ayubu ni kong acak wota ki botwu, wek wunong gum kiryo. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Tic 19:21</ref></char></note> Pien onongo yam amitoni awok botwu i wota i Makedonia, ki idwogona ki kunu, wek wukonya i wota me cito i Judaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ikare ma ayubu kitmeno onongo mono abedo ka nen calo acabe acaba iloka? An mono ka ayubu yub ci bedo macalo pa dano matye pi mitine pire kene ma kong ye, ka dok kwero woko? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Macalo Lubanga gene, lok mayam wawaco botwu pe waloko ka dok lacen wakwero woko. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Tic 18:5</ref></char></note> Pien Yecu Kricito Wod pa Lubanga mayam wan ki Silvano ki Temceo watito pire botwu pe obedo ngat ma ye ka dok lacen loke kwero woko, ento en dong omoko lok pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Piman i en gin ma Lubanga ociko ni etimo ducu ocobe kakare ikome. Meno aye gin ma omiyo wawaco ni Amen i Yecu Kricito pi miyo deyo bot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Ngat mamiyo wacung matek kacel kwedwu i Yecu Kricito, dok oyerowa me bedo jo mere, en Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />En dong omwono lanen mere woko ikomwa, dok oketo Cwiny mere Maleng i iwa, me moko ni en bimiyowa gin ducu ma en yam ociko.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Alwongo Lubanga me bedo cadena, en ngeyo gin matye icwinya ducu! Gin ma omiyo pe abino i Korint tye kit man ni onongo amito timowu kica. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Pe teloke ni wan watye ka diyowu ikom gin ma omyero wuye, wan wangeyo ni wun dong wucung matek ikom niyewu. Ento watiyo kwedwu kacel wek wubed ki yomcwiny.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Piman amoko tama pe me dwogo botwu wek pe akeliwu cwercwiny. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ka awango cwinywu, ci anga ma biyomo cwinya? Pe en dano ma awango cwinyeni? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Meno en gin ma omiyo yam acoyo waraga maca botwu, wek ka abino, jo ma myero guyom cwinya pe gumiya cwercwiny, pien onongo ageno wun ducu kun angeyo ni, yomcwinya en aye yomcwinywu bene. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Yam acoyo botwu waraga kun pig wanga cwer madwong tutwal pi cwercwiny ki kumu ma abedo kwede, pe pi cwero cwinywu, ento wek omii wunge mar madit ma atye kwede ikomwu.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Timo kica ki labalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Ka ngat mo okelo cwercwiny, nongo pe ocwero cwinya, ento nongo ocwero cwiny wun ducu. (Awaco kit man pien pe myero awac lok mapek mukato kare.) <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Kit dano macalo meno, pwod ma jo mapol ma ikinwu guketo ikome twero rome. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />En ma omiyo myero dong wutime kica, dok wukwe cwinye, wek cwercwiny madit mukato kare pe dok onure woko. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Man omiyo abako doga botwu, myero wunyut bote mar ma wutye kwede ikome. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Man aye lok ma omiyo yam acoyo waraga maca, me temowu, wek anen ka wuwinya i yo ducu. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Ka wutimo kica ki ngat mo, an bene atime kica. Pien ka atimo kica ki dano pi bal mo, atimo meno pirwu inyim Kricito, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />wek Catan pe olowa ki ryekone, pien wan pe wakwiya tame.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bale pa cwiny Paulo i Teroa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:1">Tic 20:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ma dong ao i Teroa pi tito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Kricito, yam anongo ni Rwot oyaba yo; <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />ento cwinya pe opye pien pe anongo omera Tito kunu. Ci aciko jo ma kunu, ka akato acito i Makedonia.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Loc matye i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Pwoc obed bot Lubanga ma nino ducu telowa i loc matye i Kricito, dok tiyo kwedwa wek ngec ikom Kricito ongene, macalo gin makur ma ngwece duny ikabedo ducu. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Pien wan wabedo gin makur ma Kricito owango me atyera bot Lubanga, ma ngwece duny mamit ikin jo matye i yo me lare ki jo matye i yo me rwenyo. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Dong bot jo matye ka rwenyo, en obedo gin ma ngwece kec makelo to; ento ki bot jo matye ka lare, en obedo gin ma ngwece kur makelo kwo. Anga mono matwero tic man? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Wan pe wacal ki pol pa dano mukene, ma gitito lok pa Lubanga pi nongo magoba; ento wan watito mere lok pa Lubanga keken, watito i Kricito ma cwinywa leng inyim Lubanga, macalo jo ma Lubanga ooro.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lutic me gicike manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Wan dong wacako pake kenwa? Nyo ni wan bene wamito waraga ma pwoyo kitwa botwu, kit macalo jo mogo gitye kwede, nyo waraga ki botwu ma wun wucoyo ma pwoyo kitwa? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Wun ki komwu aye dong wubedo waraga ma pwoyowa, ma kicoyo icwinywa, ma dano ducu gitwero ngeyo dok gikwano. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Nia 24:12</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Eje 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26">36:26</ref></char></note> Dong wutyeko nyutu kamaleng ni wun wubedo waraga ma oa ki bot Kricito, ma wan wakelo. Pe kicoyo ki inki ento kicoyo ki Cwiny pa Lubanga makwo, pe bene kicoyo ikom got, ento kicoyo i cwiny dano.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Aloko kitmeno labongo akalakala mo, pien wacung matek ikom Lubanga pi Kricito. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Wan ki komwa pe waromo timo gin mo kenwa; tekwa ducu oa ki bot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Jer 31:31</ref></char></note> En bene ma omiyo waromo bedo lutic me gicikene manyen ma pe obino pi cik, ento pi Cwiny Maleng. Pien cik ma kicoyo acoya kelo to, ento Cwiny Maleng kelo kwo.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:29">Nia 34:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cik mayam kigoro ki nukuta ikom got apaya ma tice me kelo to, onongo obino ki deyo, omiyo neno wang Moses oloyo jo Icrael pi nyim Moses muryeny ocaro wanggi woko, ento meno obedo ka ryeny woko motmot ki itur nyim Moses, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />ci dong tic pa Cwiny pa Lubanga deyone pe dong kato maca matek tutwal? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Pien ka tic mamiyo kop loyo dano tye ki deyo, ci tic mamiyo kikwano dano ni kitgi atir deyone pe dong kato maca woko? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Kombedi dong gin mayam tye ki deyo dong odoko gin ma peke ki deyo kadi ki acel mo, pi deyo mukene ca madong kate matek tutwali. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Pien ka gin mayam orii pi kare manok mo obino ki deyo, ci gin ma rii matwal omyero dong obed ki deyo madit makato ducu.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Pien wan watye ki kodi gen man, en ma omiyo waloko ki tekcwiny. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Nia 34:33</ref></char></note> Pe dok wacal ki Moses mayam oumu wange ki bongo, wek jo Icrael pe gunen kit maryeny me deyo ca ma ocaro wanggi ni tye ka rwenyo woko kwede itur nyime. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ento onongo tamgi yam oume woko; pien nio wa tin tamgi pud oume ikite acelu ka kikwano botgi gicike macon, pien laum ca twero kwanye ka dano tye i Kricito keken. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Kadi wa i kareni ka kikwano botgi cik pa Moses, laum ca pud oumu tamgi woko. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Nia 34:34</ref></char></note> Ento ka dano mo oloke odok bot Rwot Yecu, laum meno Lubanga kwanyo woko matwal. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Rwot ma waloko pire kanyi en Cwiny Maleng; kama Cwiny pa Rwot tye iye, kunu dano bedo agonya. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Ki wan ducu madong gikwanyo laum woko ki i wangwa watye macalo kiyo mamiyo deyo pa Rwot nen macalo ryeny ceng, ma omiyo watye ka loke me doko calo en, kun deyone mede ameda ikomwa; meno aye tic pa Rwot, ma en Cwiny Maleng.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lonyo ma kikano i atabo lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Pimeno, wan madong kiorowa i tic man pi kica pa Lubanga cwinywa pe dok tye ka dok cen. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Wan dong wadag kit tic ducu me lewic ma kitiyo i mung; dok bene watyeko kwero tic me bwolo woko ki nyobo lok pa Lubanga, ento pi tito lok ada kamaleng, wabiwot inyim Lubanga kun nongo wa nyute bot dano acel acel ikit matye atir. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Kace lok me Kwena Maber ma wan wakelo oume woko, nongo oume ki tung bot dano ma gitye ka rwenyo woko arwenya. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Pien ki tung botgi, lubanga me lobo man dong oumu tamgi woko wek pe gunen dero me lok me Kwena Maber ikom deyo pa Kricito, ma en cal pa Lubanga kikome. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Wan pe watito lok ikomwa kenwa, ento ikom Yecu Kricito, ma en aye obedo Rwot, ma wan ki komwa wadoko luticwu pi Yecu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Aca 1:3</ref></char></note> Pien Lubanga mayam owaco ni, “Dero myero oryeny kun a ki i colpiny,” en aye ma bene omiyo derone dong oryeny icwinywa. Oweko okelo ki wan dero me ngec me deyo pa Lubanga maryeny iwang Kricito.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ento wan ma watye ki lonyo man me cwiny warom ki atabo ma kicweyo ki lobo, me nyutu ni tek madwong me twero obedo gire pa Lubanga, pe oa ki botwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Peko diyowa tungi ki tungi, ento pe bwoyowa; wiwa cung woko, ento genwa pe bale; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />kiunuwa, ento Lubanga pe wekowa ata; kibolowa piny i ngom ligwek, ento pe bene wato. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Nino ducu watingo to pa Yecu ikomwa, wek kwo pa Yecu bene onen woko kamaleng ikomwani. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Pien nino ducu wan ma wakwo wamine me to pi Yecu, wek omii kwo pa Yecu onen woko kamaleng ikomwa ma toni. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ma omiyo to tye katic ikomwa, ento kwo tye katic ikomwu.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:10">Jab 116:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Wan watye ki kit cwiny acelu me niye mayam omiyo kicoyo ni, “Aye, en ma omiyo aloko.” Wan bene waye, ma omiyo watye kalok. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Wangeyo ni, ngat ma ocero Rwotwa Yecu bicerowa bene kacel ki Yecu, ci bikelowa inyime kacel kwedwu. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Pien meno ducu otime pirwu, wek kica pa Lubanga omede bot jo mapol, wek gin bene gumede ki pwoc madwong makelo deyo bot Lubanga.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo ki niye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />En aye gin ma omiyo cwinywa dok pe tye ka dok cen. Kadi bed kwowa ma woko tye ka bale, ento kwo ma i iwa tye ka roc, doko nyen nino ki nino. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Pien aun ma kiunuwa kwede pe pek, bedo pi kare manok mo keken, dok bene tye ka yubu botwa deyo mapek ma pe tum, madit matek makato ducu. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Pien pe waciko wangwa ikom gin manen, ento ikom gin ma pe nen. Gin manen bedo pi kare manok mo keken, ento gin ma pe nen rii pi naka.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Pien wangeyo ni ka komwa me lobo man obale woko, ma wabedo iye macalo wabedo ikemani wan watye ki gedo mukene ma Lubanga bimiyo botwa, ot ma pe kigero ki cing, ot matye ma bibedo matwal i polo. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Piman wan ma wacur acura i bolo man kun wamito matek ni kirukwa ki kom ma a ki i polo, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />pien ka dong watyeko rukune, ci pe kibinongo ni dok watye munero. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Pien ka pud watye i kema man, wacur acura pi peko ma odiyowa; pe ni wamito lunyu komwa me loboni woko, ento wamito ni waruk kom manyen iwi man, wek gin ma kwo omwony gin ma to woko. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Ngat ma oyubuwa pi lok man kikome aye Lubanga, dok bene omiyowa Cwinye calo gin ma Lubanga omiyo ma moko ni en bicobo gin ma en ociko.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />En ma omiyo nino ducu wadiyo cwinywa maber, kun bene wangeyo ni, ka watye i paco me komwa eni, wabedo bor ki Rwot, <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />pien kwowa cung ikom niye, pe i neno piny ma waneno. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Wan wadiyo cwinywa maber, kun watamo ni twara wawot ma wabwoto komwa woko, wek wabed paco bot Rwot. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Dong kadi watye i paco kany nyo kunu, waketo cwinywa me bedo jo ma giyomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:10">Rom 14:10</ref></char></note> Pien wan ducu myero wacung inyim Kricito wek ongol kop ikomwa, wek dano acel acel onong gin ma otiko en, ma lubu kit mayam otiyo ikare ma pud tye ikom, ka ber nyo ka rac.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Roco wat ki Lubanga i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Dong macalo wangeyo ni Rwot myero kilwor, watemo ywayo tam pa dano, ma kitwa nen woko kamaleng bot Lubanga; ageno bene ni kitwa otyeko nen botwu ki ngec matye icwinywu ma nyutiwu bal. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Pe dok wapake kenwa, ento watye kamiyo botwu gin ma myero wuwake kwede pirwa, wek wubed ki yo me gamo dog jo ma giwake pi gin manen ki woko, pe pi kit ma dano tye kwede i cwinye. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Ka dong wadoko jo ma lupoya, wapo giwa pi Lubanga; ento ka wiwa tye katic maber, meno bikonyowu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Pien mar pa Kricito loyo kwowa, pien dong waniang maber kit man ni, ngat acel oto pi jo ducu, ma omiyo jo ducu dong guto. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />En yam oto pi dano ducu, wek jo makwo pe gumede ki bedo kwo pirgi ken gi, ento gubed ki kwo pi ngat mayam oto ka ocer pirgi ca.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />En ma omiyo cake kombedi, wan pe wangeyo dano mo ikit me lobo man; kadi bed yam wangeyo Kricito ikit me lobo, pe dok wangeye kitmeno. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />En ma omiyo ka ngat mo tye i Kricito, en dong bedo gin ma kicweyo manyen; gin macon nongo dong orwenyo woko, gin manyen dong oleyo kakare. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Meno ducu obedo tic ma Lubanga otiyo, mayam odwokowa kwede bote, pi Kricito, dok bene omiyowa tic me dwoko dano bote. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Man teloke ni, i Kricito, Lubanga onongo yam tye ka dwoko dano ma i lobo bote, kun pe okwano balgi ikomgi, dok bene omiyowa lok me kwena ikom kit ma en dong odwokogi kwede bote. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />En ma omiyo wadoko lukwena, luwang Kricito; Lubanga legowu ki dwonwa, wan bene wabako dogwa botwu ma ka Kricito ni, Wuwek Lubanga odwokwu bote. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Ngat mayam pe ongeyo bal, Lubanga oloke odoko bal pirwa, wek i en wadok jo ma nywako kit pa Lubanga matye atir.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />I ticwa kacel ki Lubanga bene walegowu ni, kit madong wunongo kwede kica pa Lubangani, pe dok wuwek obale nono. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Ica 49:8</ref></char></note> Pien Lubanga waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Yam awinyi ikare me timo dano maber,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">yam akonyi ikare me laro dano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:2">Wunen, man aye kare ma kitimo iye ber bot dano. Tin aye nino me lare. <verse eid="2CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Wan pe wamito waket ariya mo i yo pa ngat mo, wek dano pe guwac ni ticwa rac; <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />ento wan macalo lutic pa Lubanga ikare ducu wanyutu berwa kenwa i yo ducu: kun waciro can, ki peko, ki ayelayela ma odiyowa matek tutwal. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Tic 16:23</ref></char></note> Kipwodowa, kitweyowa i buc, dano guroko lwak me lweny ikomwa, watiyo tic matek, ma nino ki cam bene remowa. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Wanyutu ni wan lutic pa Lubanga pi kitwa maleng, pi ngec ma watye kwede, pi diyo cwinywa ki pi kicawa. Pi Cwiny Maleng, ki pi mar ma watye kwede ma goba peke iye, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />pi tito lok me ada, ki pi tek pa Lubanga. Dong wamako jami lweny me kit ma atir i cingwa ryoryo, tung acuc ki tung acam. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Kiketo deyo ikomwa, dok bene kiketo lewic ikomwa, kiyetowa dok bene kipakowa. Kiterowa macalo lugoba, ento kun wan jo me ada. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Kiterowa macalo jo ma pe gingene, ento ki ngeyowa tutwal. Kilokowa wadoko calo jo ma oto, kun wan mere jo makwo. Kadi kitimwa gujiguji, pe kinekowa; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />kadi kimiyo wakumu, cwinywa nongo pud bedo yom nino ducu; wanen macalo lucan, ento wan aye ma wamiyo jo mapol gudoko lulonyo; wanen calo pe watye ki gin mo, ento kun kono watye ki jami ducu.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Wun jo Korint, wan dong waloko kwedwu kamaleng, dok bene dong wanyutu mar ma icwinywa botwu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Wan pe cwinywa oa woko ikomwu, ento wun aye cwinywu oari woko ki ikomwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />An aloko kwedwu macalo wun lutinona; kit ma watimowu kwede, wun bene wutim kitmeno; wuket cwinywu ikomwa me marowa.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ot pa Lubanga makwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Pe wuribe kun wubedo kacel ki jo ma pe guye Yecu, pien kitwu patpat. Dong kit ma atir ki tim maracu gitwero bedo lurem ningning? Dero ki colpiny gitwero ribe gibedo kacel ningning? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Dong tam pa Kricito ki pa Catan twero rwate? Gin ango ma dano ma oye Yecu twero nywako gin ki ngat ma pe oye? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">6:19</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Eje 37:27</ref></char></note> Ot pa Lubanga kono twero ribe ningning ki cal jogi? Pien wan aye wabedo Ot pa Lubanga makwo; macalo en Lubanga dong owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“An abibedo i igi, kun awoto ikin gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">abibedo Lubangagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">gin bene gibibedo jona.<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:11">Ica 52:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Pimeno dong wua woko ki ikin gi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Wupoke woko kwedgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">pe wugud gin mo ma kome kikeni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">ci abijolowu.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Cam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 17:13">2 Tek 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Ica 43:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Jer 31:9</ref></char>
    </note> Abibedo Wonwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">wun bene wubibedo awobena ki anyirana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">man lok pa Rwot Won Twer Ducu.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Wun ma amaro, cike meno yam kiciko pirwa. Pimeno, myero walonye woko kekenwa i gin mo ducu ma cido komwa nyo cwinywa, kun walworo Lubanga, wek wadoku jo maleng atikatika.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yomcwiny pa Paulo pi ngut pa jo Korint</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Wuyab cwinywu botwa; pe watimo ngat mo marac, pe wabalo ikom ngat mo, pe bene wabuyo ngat mo pi mito lim. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Pe awaco man ni wek kop olowu, pien yam awaco botwu kong ni wun pirwu lit botwa mada, wek wato dok wakwo kacel kwedwu. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Atye ki gen mada ikomwu; awake bene matek pirwu. Cwinya okwe maber, dok apong ki yomcwiny icanwa ducu.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 2:13">2 Kor 2:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Cake ikare ma wao i Makedonia pe wabedo ki yweyo mo. Can onongo orumuwa woko i yo ducu, lweny ikin dano ki lworo ma onongo tye icwinywa. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ento Lubanga ma kweyo cwiny jo ma can obwoyogi, okweyo cwinywa pi bino pa Tito. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Pe pi binone keken, ento bene pi kit ma wun wukweyo kwede cwinye. En otito botwa kit ma wucuku kwede cwinye, dok bene otito pi cwercwiny ma wutye kwede, ki kit ma kee nena nekowu kwede, ci omedo yomcwinya ameda.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Kadi bed waragana ca yam ocwero cwinywu, an pe dong angut pi coyone, kadi bed yam angut pien aneno ni waraga ca ocwero cwinywu pi kare mo. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Kombedi an cwinya yom, pe teloke ni pien awango cwinywu, ento pien wangcwinywu omiyo wungut. Wangcwinywu meno onongo oa ki bot Lubanga, wek pe wunong can mo ki botwa. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Pien wangcwiny ma Lubanga miyo kelo ngut ma tero dano i lare, ma koko ange mo peke iye; ento wangcwiny me lobo kelo to. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Kong wunen kit ma Lubanga otiyo kwede ki wangcwinywu! Dong wunen kit ma wuketo kwede cwinywu, kit madong wuketo kwede tek me nyutu ni wupe ki bal, kit akemowu, kit lworo, ki kit ma wuculu kwede kwor! Wun dong wutyeko nyute woko kenwu i yo ducu ni pe wutye ki bal mo ilok meno. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ma omiyo kadi bed acoyo botwu waraga, pe acoyo pi ngat ma otimo gin marac, kadi pi ngat ma gitimo gin marac ikome, ento acoyo wek omii kit ma wuparo kwede pira onen woko kamaleng botwu inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Man en aye gin ma omiyo cwinya okwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Medo ikom kweyo cwinywa, yam wabedo ki yomcwiny mada pi yomcwiny pa Tito, pien wun ducu wukonyo me kweyo cwinye. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Kadi bed yam awake inyime pirwu, lewic pe omaka; ento kit macalo yam lok ducu ma wabedo katito botwu obedo lok me ada, kitmeno wakewa bene inyim Tito obedo me ada. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Kace en po ikom kit macalo wun ducu wuwinye kwede, ki kit ma wujole kwede ki lworo ki myelkom, ci mar mede ameda i iye ikomwu. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />An cwinya yom, pien atye ki gen madit ikomwu i yo ducu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Miyo mot pa Lukricitayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:26">Rom 15:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Utmegiwa, wamito ni wunge pi cwiny me kica ma oa ki bot Lubanga ma onen bot lwak dano ma guye Kricito ducu ma gitye i Makedonia. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Gin guciro peko ducu ma gulimo; ento yomcwinygi obedo dit mada en ma omiyo gumiyo mic madit ma okato kare. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Pien gin yam gumiyo mic ma giromo miyone, ki makatone bene, kit ma an ki koma aneno kwede, pe kidiyogi iye adiya. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Gin gulegowa ma gibako dog gi ni watim ber, waye gin giribe kwedwa i konyo jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Yam gutiyo tic mukato genwa woko, pien gukwongo mine ken gi bot Lubanga, ka dong pi mit pa Lubanga gucako mine ken gi botwa bene. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ka dong wacuku cwiny Tito ni, kit macalo yam dong en ocako tic man me kica ikinwu, myero bene dong ocob woko. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Dong macalo wun wutiyo tic maber i yo ducu: ikom niye, iloko lok, ingec, iketo cwinywu ki i mar ma wutye kwede ikomwa, ber wumede bene i tic man me kica.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Gin ma alokoni pe obedo cik ma an aye amiyo, ento anyutu botwu kit ma jo mukene giketo cwinygi, wek anen mar ma wutye kwede ka obedo mar me ada. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Pien wungeyo cwiny me kica ma Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obedo kwede; kadi bed nene en lalonyo, ento pirwu oloke odoko lacan, wek icane ni wun wudok lulonyo. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Man tama ma amiyo ilok man: twero bedo ber ka wutyeko gin mayam wucako i mwaka mukatoni woko. Yam wun aye wubedo jo mukwongo, pe i tic keken, ento i yeyo me tiyo tic bene. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Kombedi amito wumede wuwot anyim ki ticwu ca, wucob woko. Wubed ki miti me tyekone marom aroma ki maca mayam wukwongo kwede, kun wukwanyo gin mamite ki ikom gin matye botwu. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Lubanga gamo mot ma dano tye kwede, teke en obedo ki miti me miyone, ma pe paro gin ma pe etye kwede. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Pe awaco ni jo mukene gubed maber, wun aye can odiwu, ento ni dano ducu gubed maromrom. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Kit macalo kombedi wutye ki jami mabupi, wukonygi icangi, wek ka wang mo gin gubedo ki jami mabup, gin bene gubikonywu ki gin murem botwu, ci dong miyo wubedo maromrom. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Nia 16:18</ref></char></note> Macalo yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">“Ngat ma ocoko mabup, pe obedo ki mapol ma okato kare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">ngat ma ocoko manok mo, pe obedo ki manok ma okato kare.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tito ki luwote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Wapwoyo Lubanga pien oketo i Tito miti madwong marom ki mewa me konyowu. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />En pe ojolo legawa keken, ento cwinye tye iye matek, ma omiyo en gire bino botwu pi mitine kene. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Waore kacel ki ominwa ca ma ngene tutwal bot jo ducu ma guye Kricito pi kit ma en tito kwede lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Pe meno keken, ento lwak dano ducu ma guye Kricito yam guyere me wot kacel kwedwa i tic man me kica ma watye katiyone pi miyo deyo bot Rwot, ki pi mitiwa me miyo kony bot dano. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Watemo gwoke matek wek ngat mo pe onong bal mo ikit ma watye katic kwede ki mot man mabup ma kiketo i cingwani. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Car 3:4</ref> </char></note> Tamwa tye me timo gin maber, pe inyim Lubanga keken, ento kadi wa inyim dano bene. <verse eid="2CO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Dong waorogi kacel ki ominwa mukene ma wabedo ka temo kite pi kare malac, ci wanongo ni en obedo dano ma keto cwinye ikom tic mapol, ento i kareni dong tye kaketo cwinye matek tutwal makato mayam con, pi gen madit ma en tye kwede ikomwu. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Tito lawota dok latic wadiwa pirwu, ki utmegiwa mukenegu, gin lukwena pa jo ducu ma guye Kricito, gin bene aye jo makelo deyo bot Kricito. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Pimeno, wunyut mar ma wutye kwede woko kamaleng bot dano ducu ma guye Kricito, wek gunen ni nyatewa ma wanyate kwede pirwu onongo tye atir.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Jami ma kimiyo pi konyo jo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Kombedi pe dong mite ni aco waraga botwu ikom lok me mot ma kimiyo pi konyo jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Pien angeyo miti ma wutye kwede me miyo kony, omiyo atye ka nyate pirwu mada bot jo Makedonia kun awaco botgi ni, jo me Akaya guyube woko wa con cake i mwaka mukato. Pi cuke ma wubedo ka cuke kwede, omiyo polgi bene guketo cwinygi. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Dong acwalo utmegiwa botwu enu wek nyatewa pirwu ilok man pe ogik ilok keken, ento myero wubed ma wuyube ikit ma awaco botgini. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Kace ao kunu ki jo Makedonia mogo, ka kibinongo ni pe wuyube, ci miyo doga two woko, pi gen ma onongo waketo ikomwu; ento wun kono lewic pe bimakowu? <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo atamo me cuko cwiny utmegiwa me kwongo nyima me bino botwu, wek gin aye kong gunen ka wuyubu mot man mayam wucike me miyoneni; wek dong obed ma kiyubu woko macalo mot ma wumiyo giwu ki cwinywu kenwu ma pe kidiyowu iye adiya.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Lok tye kit man ni, dano ma coyo kodi manok, bikayo bene manok, ngat ma coyo kodi madwong, bikayo bene mabup. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Dano acel acel myero otim kit macalo cwinye mito, labongo gungcwiny mo nyo dic mo. Pien Lubanga maro ngat mamiyo jamine ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Dok Lubanga twero miyo botwu jami mabeco mapol ata, wek kare ducu wubed ki jami ma romowu maber, ma weko wun bene wutwero miyo kony mabup pi konyo tic ducu mabeco. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Jab 112:9</ref></char></note> Macalo yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Ocoro jamine mapol, omiyo ki lucan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">bere bedo nakanaka.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:10">Ica 55:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ngat mamiyo kodi bot dano ma laco kodi, ki cam me acama, bimiyowu kodi dok binyayone bene, ci dong miyo gin ma oa ikom cwiny maber ma wutye kwede bedo dit tutwal. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />En bimiyo wulony i yo ducu, maromo miyo wubedo ki cwiny maber me miyo mot ikare ducu; ci ka watero mot man bot jo mamito kony ci bimiyogi pwoyo Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Pien tic me kony macalo man ma wutiyo bikelo gin mamite bot jo pa Lubanga; pe meno keken, ento bikelo bene pwoc madit tutwal bot Lubanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Pi gin maber ma ticwu kelo, bimiyo jo mapol gimiyo deyo bot Lubanga, pien nyutu winy maber ma wutye kwede ilok me Kwena Maber ikom Kricito ma watito, ki pi cwiny maber ma wupoko kwede limwu bot jonu ki bot jo mukene ducu. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Gin bilego Lubanga pirwu bene kun cwinygi paro pirwu, pi kica pa Lubanga madit ma okato kare madong onen ikomwu. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Kipwo Lubanga pi mote maber ma pe wace.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pido pa Paulo pi tice ma kilwonge iye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />An Paulo akok botwu kun abako doga pi mwolo ki pi kica pa Kricito. An ma kiwaco ni amwol dok awor bene ka atye kacel kwedwu, ento abedo ger ka atye cen kamabor. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Alegowu ni ka abino botwu, pe wumiya abed ki kit gero ki tekcwiny ma ageno ni atwero bedo kwede ikom jo mogo ma gitamo ni wan walubu kit me lobo man. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />I adane wan wabedo i lobo, ento pe watye ka lwenyo lweny ikit me lobo. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Pien jami lweny ma watiyo kwedgi me lwenywa pe obedo jami lweny me lobo man, ento gubedo jami lweny me tek pa Lubanga, ma turu cel gogo pa lumerokwa woko. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Waturu kwede tam ma pe atir, ki kit wake ducu ma tinge malo me pyem, ma gengo dano miyo pe gingeyo Lubanga, kun wamako tam acel acel macalo opii, waketo ite loc pa Kricito. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Dok bene wayube me miyo pwod ikom lujemo ducu ma gipe ki winy, kace nongo wun dong wutyeko mine kenwu me bedo luwiny.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Amitoni Wunen gin matye ikinwu. Kace dano mo tye ki gen ni en dano pa Kricito, kong myero otam bene ni, macalo en dano pa Kricito, wan bene watye kitmeno. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Pien kadi bed anyate matek tutwal pi twero ma Rwot omiyo botwa, lewic pe bimaka. Pien en omiyo twero meno botwa me konyowu, pi dongowu, ento pe me dwokowu cen. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Pe amitoni anen botwu macalo ngat matye kaburuwu ki waraga ma acoyogu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Pien dano gitye ka waco ni waragana pek dok gwa, ento ka ao botwu nongo anen goro, dok wa loka ma aloko botwu bene konye peke. <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Jo macalo meno myero guniang ni, pe tye apokapoka mo ilok ma wacoyo i waragawa ka watye cen kamabor, ki gin ma wabitimo ka watye kacel kwedwu.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Pe watinge me kete kenwa i rwom acel ki dano mogo ma ikin jo ma gimaro kore ken gi, nyo me pore kenwa kwedgi. Kit ma gitye ka pime kwede ikin gi keken gi, dok bene gipore ken gi ki gin me poregi ma ginongo ikin gi ken gi, kit jo macalo meno gin luming. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ento wan giwa pe wabinyate makato kare; wabigik mewa ki tic mayam Lubanga opoko botwa, ma wun bene wutye iye. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Wan pe wamedo wangcowa. Wan watiyo idwol ma kipoko botwa keken ikare ma wabino botwu, pien wan aye mayam wakwongo bino botwu me tito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Kricito. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Pe wanyate ma okato kare ikom tic ma jo mukene aye guyele iye; ento watye ki gen ni ka niyewu dong omede, ticwa bene bimede matek ikinwu, kun lubu kama yam kityeko poko botwa. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Man bimiyo watito lok me Kwena Maber i lobo mukene ma gitye tung kupotoceng, kun pe wanyate pi tic ma jo mukene gutiyo i katic pa ngat mukene. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Ento yam kicoyo ni,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9:24</ref></char></note> “Ngat ma nyate myero onyate pi Rwot.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Pien pe ngat ma pake kekene en aye ma Lubanga pwoyo, ento dano ma Rwot dworo.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo ki lukwena ma lugoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Kono onongo wutwero diyo cwinywu manok mo ikoma i mingonani. Kong wudii cwinywu ba! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Nyeko omaka pirwu ki lakodi nyeko ma Lubanga tye kwede bene ni; pien wucal ki nyako ma ayubu me nyome ki laco acel, kun ageno ni abitere bot cware, en aye Kricito, kun en nyako maleng ma pud peya ongeyo laco mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-5">Aca 3:1-5</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:13">13</ref></char></note> Ento atye ki lworo ni, kit macalo twol yam obwolo Kawa ki ryekone, wun bene dano bibalo tamwu woko, mamiyo pe dong wubimaro Kricito ki cwinywu ducu ki mar maleng. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Pien ka ngat mo obino botwu, katito botwu pi Yecu mukene mapat ki maca ma watito pire botwuni, nyo omiyowu cwiny mapat ki mayam wutye kwede, nyo otito lok me kwena mo mapat ki mayam wujoloni, meno bidiyo cwinywu me ye loke woko. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Ki i tama, aneno ni lukwena madongo ma gukato kare ca pe gikata kadi ki acel. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Gwok nyo pe aryek ilok, ento aryek ingec mada. Meno yam dong wanyutu botwu kamaleng, i yo ducu ki ikare ducu.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Wutamoni yam atimo bal ce ka mwole kena wek aket dit ikomwu, kun atito botwu lok me Kwena Maber ma oa ki bot Lubanga labongo gamo cul mo? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Kitwero waco ni yam ayako lwak pa Kricito kamukene pirwu, pien ceng agamo lim ki botgi pi tica botwu. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Pili 4:15-18</ref></char></note> Dok bene ikare ma onongo atye botwu, ka can jami mo omaka, pe ayelo ngat mo ikinwu, pien utmego ma gua ki i Makedonia gukelo kony ducu mamite pira. Onongo abedo ma agwoke, dok bene abigwoke, wek pe amii ki wun peko mo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Dong awaco botwu ni, macalo ada pa Kricito tye icwinya, pe gibigengo nyatena ilok man i lobo Akaya ducu. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Pingo? Pien ni pe amarowu? Lubanga ngeyo ni amarowu.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Gin ma atiyo abimede kitiyone, wek pe amii jo ca gunong kare ma gimito wek gumi onen ni gin girom aroma kwedwa i tic ma ginyate iyenu. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Pien jonu pe gin lukwena kikome, gin lutic ma gibwolo dano, ma giloke woko ginen calo lukwena pa Kricito. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ngat mo myero pe obed ki ur ilok man, pien kadi Catan kikome bene loke nen macalo lamalaika ma menyo piny. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Man pe dong gin ma pire dit tutwal kace lutic pa Catan giloke ginen calo lutic ma tiyo gin ma atir; agikigi bibedo rom ki gin ma gutiyo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Can ma opoto ikom Paulo pi bedo Lakwena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Anwoyo dok odoco ni, ngat mo pe opar ni an laming; ento kadi bed wutamo kitmeno, ci dong wujola macalo dano maming, wek omiya bene anyate manoknok. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Gin ma atye kawacone botwuni pe gin ma Rwot aye omiya ni awac botwu; aloko calo dano maming ki gen man ma atye kwede me nyate. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Macalo jo mapol ginyate pi gin me lobo ikit me dano, an bene abinyate. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Pien wun wukanyo jo ma luming ki yomcwiny, pien wun jo maryek mada! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Wukanyo cwinywu kadi ka ngat mo lokowu me doko opiine, nyo camo limwu, nyo buyuwu, nyo lakwote, nyo kadi dongo lemwu. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Lewic omaka omiyo aye ni wan yam pe wabedo tek i yo meno!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ento gin mo keken ma dano okete me nyate pire, an bene akete woko me nyate kitmeno, ma onongo pud aloko macalo laming. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Gin mono gubedo jo Ibru? An bene. Gin jo Icrael? An bene. Gin mono likwayo Abraim? An bene. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Tic 16:23</ref></char></note> Gin lutic pa Kricito? An gira aloko calo dano ma lapoya, awaco ni, akatogi woko. Atiyo tic aloyogi, ari i buc akatogi, kigoya ma wel odoone pe kwane, abwot ki i lak to tyen mapol. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:3">Nwo 25:3</ref></char></note> Lujudaya gugoya ki odo anino pyere adek wiye abongwen tyen abic. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Tic 16:22</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:19">Tic 14:19</ref></char></note> Kigoya ki odo tyen adek, kicela bene ki got kicel, mel otur woko kweda tyen adek; abutu ari i nam matut dyeceng ki dyewor benebene tyen acel. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Tic 9:23</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:5">Tic 14:5</ref></char></note> Ari i wot mapol ma can bene opoto ikoma, can ma oa ki i lwak kulu mupong ki pii, can ma oa bot luyak, can ma oa bot lutuwa, can ma lurok guketo ikoma, can manen i gang, can manen i tim, can ma poto i nam, ki can ma a ki bot utmego ma gin lugoba. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Acane tutwal i tic matek; tyen mapol pe anino dyewor. Ari kec ki orwo pii; tyen mapol abedo labongo cam mo ma roma, dok abedo i piny mangic labongo ginaruka. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Medo ikom gin jami mukenegu ducu, tye gin acel makelo peko bota kare ki kare, en aye par ma atye kwede pi jo ma oye Kricito ikabedo mapatpat ducu. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Tye ngat mo ma goro ma kun an pe agoro? Tye ngat mo ma kimiyo opoto i bal ma cwinya pe owang pire?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Kace onongo myero anyate, abinyate pi gin ma nyutu gorona. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Lubanga Won Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, ma kipako nakanaka, en ngeyo ni pe aloko goba. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Tic 9:23-25</ref></char></note> Ikare ma onongo atye i Damaciko, laloc mo me dul lobo matye ite loc pa rwot Areta obedo ka kiyo gang meno ni wek emaka, <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />ento kicwala woko ki aduku madit kun kimiyo akato ki iwang dirica ma ikom cel, ci omiyo abwot woko ki i cinge.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Gin ma Rwot onyutu bot Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Omyero anyate; kadi bed pe anongo iye gin mo, abilok ikom gin ma aneno iwang lek ki gin ma Rwot onyutu bota. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Angeyo dano mo ikin jo pa Kricito mayam kitingo kitero woko malo wa i polo me adeke, kombedi dong okato mwaka apar wiye angwen kulu. (Ka kono Lubanga otingo kome, kono nyo omiye oleko aleka, an gira pe angeyo, ento Lubanga ngeyo.) <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Angeyo ni dano meno yam kitinge malo kitere wa i Paradic. (Kace Lubanga otingo kome, gwok nyo omiye oleko aleka, pe angeyo, ento Lubanga ngeyo.) <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Yam owinyo lok mogo ma pe myero oloke kamaleng, ma pe kiye ni dano mo otuci. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Kit lok pa dano macalo meno aye bimiyo anyate, ento pira kena pe abinyate, ento kono pi gorona aye keken. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Kadi bed onongo nen calo amito nyate, pe abibedo laming pien nongo aloko lok ada. Ento pe abinyate, wek dano mo pe obed ki par ikoma makato gin ma en oneno ikoma, nyo lok ma en owinyo awinya ki bota. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Me gwoka wek pe alyere kena ma okato kare pi lwak jami mapol mayam Lubanga onyutu bota, yam kiketo arem ikoma ma obedo calo laor pa Catan, wek pe akete malo kekena ma okato kare. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Yam alego Rwot piman tyen adek ni jami macalo meno oa woko ki ikoma. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Cutcut en ogamo ni, “Kicana tye ma romi, pien tekona bedo tek tutwal kama goro tye iye.” En meno gin ma omiyo anyate ki yomcwiny madit tutwal pi gorona, wek tek pa Kricito obed ikoma. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Pi Kricito omiyo cwinya yom pi goro mapatpat ma atye kwede, ki pi yet, ki pi can, ki pi peko mogo ma giuna kwede, ki peko ma diya matek; pien kama agoro iye, kenyo en aye kama atek iye.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Par pa Paulo ikom Kanica me Korint</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Onongo abedo laming! Wun aye ma wucora iye, pien onongo myero wun aye wudwora. Lukwena madito mukato kare ca pe gikata kadi ki acel, kadi bed an pe a gin mo. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Gin ducu ma nyutu ni an lakwena kikome yam otime ikinwu ki diyo cwiny madit, lanyut mogo, tango ki tic me aura madito. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ngo mayam oremowu makato lwak muye Kricito ikabedo mukene ducu? Gwok nyo man keken ni an yam pe abedo ka nuruwu ki peko? Wutima ber, kace onongo abalo pi koyowu woko kitmeno!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Man dong tyen me adek ma ayube me bino kwede botwu, ento dong pe abimiyo peko nuruwu. Pien an pe amito jamiwu, ento amito wun ki komwu. Lutino aye pe kano jami me mono pi lunyodogi, ento lunyodo aye ma kano jami me mono pi lutinogi. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Abibedo ki yomcwiny madit me miyo jami ducu ma atye kwede, kadi wa tek koma ducu, pi konyo kwo me tipuwu. Wubimara manoknok ni, pien amarowu matek? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Wek wuter ni an ki koma pe onuruwu ki peko. Ento ngat mo biwaconi an ladwala, ci abwolowu ki lok goba. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Tye ngat mo ikin jo ma nene acwalogi botwuni, ma obuyo gin mo ki botwu pira? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Onongo alego Tito ni myero ociti, ka dok aoro ominwa mukene me wot kacel kwede. Tito obuyowu? Yam pe watiyo tic ki kit cwiny acel? Onongo pe wabedo katic i yo acelu?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Wun wutamo ni watye ka pido pirwa kenwa kare man ducu inyimwu? Pe kumeno; wan watye kalok inyim Lubanga, macalo jo pa Kricito. Dok bene, wun ma amaro, aloko me konyowu wek wudong wudok jo muteggi. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Pien alworo ni ka ao kunu, gwok nyo abinongo wupat ki kit ma amito wubed kwede, dok wun bene gwok nyo wubinongo apat ki kit ma wumito abed kwede. Gwok nyo abinongo wutye ki daa, nyeko, kiniga malyet, laro dito, yet, lok kwot, lok me bwolo ki anyobanyoba. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Alworo bene ni ka adwogo botwu i anyim, Lubangana bimiyo lewic maka woko inyimwu; ci bimiyo akok pi jo mapol ikin dano mayam gutimo bal, ka dong gukwero ngut woko ikom timgi me caro, me abor ki me kwele.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Cik me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nwo 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char>
    </note> Man dong tyen me adek ma abio kwede botwu. Caden maromo aryo nyo adek aye myero gumok lok ducu ma kikelo me alara, macalo yam kicoyo. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Lok man yam atito botwu con ikare ma atye i wota me aryo, dok anwoyo wacone kombedi madong atye cen, bot jo mayam gubalo, ki bot jo mukene ducu ni meno, ka dok adwogo botwu pe tye ngat mo ma bibwot ki i pwod. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Pien wumito neno gin ma moko ni Kricito aye matye kalok idoga. Ento ka en tye katic ikinwu en pe bedo goro ento en nyutu tek ma mere ikinwu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Yam kigure ikom yatariya pi gorone, ento kombedi en kwo pi tek pa Lubanga. Kadi wan bene wagoro i en, ento i ticwa kwedwu wabibedo kacel kwede pi tek pa Lubanga.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Kong wungine kekenwu, wek wunen kace wucung matek i niyewu. Wuteme kekenwu. Pe wuniang ni Yecu Kricito tye i iwu? Nikwanyo ka wupoto woko adada! <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ageno ni wubiniang maber ni wan mere pe wabedo jo ma pe piny oloyogi. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ento walego Lubanga pirwu ni pe wutim gin mo marac, pe me nyutu ni wan jo ma Lubanga pwoyo, ento wamito ni wun wutim gin maber, kadi bed wanen calo jo ma piny oloyogi. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Pien wan pe watwero tiyo gin mo ma pe rwate ki lok ada, ento watwero tiyo gin ma rwate ki gin matye ada keken. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Cwinywa yom ka wagoro ma nongo wun wutek, dok walego pirwu ni wudok jo muteggi. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Gin ma omiyo acoyo lok ma pud atye kamabor kwedwu, wek pe abed ger ikomwu ka abino, kun atiyo ki twero mayam Rwot omiya wek akonywu me dongo, ento pe me dwokowu cen.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Me agikine, utmegina, dong acwaliwu mot. Wuyub kitwu wek odok maber, dok bene myero wuwiny kokona pi gin ma alegowu pire. Wubed ki cwiny acel, wubed bene ki kuc, ci Lubanga ma won mar ki kuc bibedo kwedwu. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Wumote kekenwu ki mot me mar. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Lwak pa Lubanga ducu gumotowu.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, ki mar pa Lubanga, ki ribe ma Cwiny Maleng kelo obed kwedwu ducu.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>